<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31249" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσᾰγωγ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bringing in,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδάτων, ὕδατος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.3.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				3.804
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aspendus</span>) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					5.500
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>introduction,</i> as of heirs by adoption, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				10.9
			</span></i> (pl.); of children to a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρατρία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1237.108
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>importation</i> of goods, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				847d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1360a14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				278.11
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Priene</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>raising</i> of taxes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.31.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as law-term, <i>bringing of causes into court,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				855d
			</span></i>(pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κλήρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					4.12
				</span></i>
			 (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>introduction</i> to a subject, <i>elementary teaching,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				56.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Amm.</u>
				2.1
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.487
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				1.29.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.428
			</span></i> (pl.) ; <i>elementary treatise,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εἰ. εἰς τὴν περὶ ἀγαθῶν καὶ κακῶν
				πραγματείαν,</span> title of work by Chrysippus, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.43f
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Libr.Propr.Prooem.</u>
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>channel of entrance</i> to a harbour, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
				37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>office of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσαγωγεύς</span> II, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
